om/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc151rs.jpg"}, {"id": 1915193, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc151rt.jpg"}], "slug": "gradanix", "summary": "Gradanix is a permadeath co-op action RPG roguelike. Players pick one of seven classes - warrior, paladin, rogue, hunter, mage, priest or warlock - and descend through an endless, procedurally generated dungeon that grows harder with every level, with a boss encounter every seventh floor. Death ends a run permanently, and the depth reached is the score, recorded on global leaderboards that run in three-month seasons. Runs can be played solo, in online co-op or over LAN, with experience shared evenly between party members. An optional Corruption dial increases enemy difficulty and rewards, the first player to find each legendary item is recorded permanently as a world first, and characters keep their level, talents, bank and personal house between seasons.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gradanix"}